{"ID":"20240314091844-0rx1ccd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091844-0rx1ccd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091844-0rx1ccd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170207-ewwpwsb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170207-eaba5aa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170207-eaba5aa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:16\u0026#125;","title":"【紫参汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170207-ewwpwsb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-ewwpwsb","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下利肺痛，紫参汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-etya7g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-etya7g3","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-8wkiyce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-8wkiyce","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参半斤甘草三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-91onvtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-91onvtf","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，以水五升，先煮紫参，取二升，内甘草，煮取一升半，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-cw1p0rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-cw1p0rl","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在出现这个下利的条辨，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下利肺痛，紫参汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，过去的经方家，尤其像曹颖甫他们，这种症呢，他们说紫参就是桔梗，桔梗在肺阴篇里面是排脓汤，专门排肺里面的脓疡，那主要的症状是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人咳嗽，吐出来的白色的泡沫，痰是白色的，我们知道这个人有肺癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那用桔梗。那临症上面来看的时候，这个桔梗是吐脓效果很好。真的要治疗肺癌的时候，还需要加把劲，光用桔梗甘草没有用，真正最好是紫参。我上次跟大家介绍过紫参，没有了。那外面看到的是紫根、紫草。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-kzsb4h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-kzsb4h8","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫参呢，按照神农本草经的记载，上面的是珍珠菜，是一种叶菜类的珍珠菜，珍珠菜的根是紫黑色的，这是真正的紫参，现在没有卖，因为没有这个药了。那如果是有这个紫参的话，两味药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫参，甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个怎么剂量多少？甘草是 3，这一个是 6"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们很多的处方，桂枝干草汤，大黄甘草汤，茯苓甘草汤，半夏甘草汤，很多处方你在使用的时候都是 2 比 1，2 比 1 甘草的比例，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当单味药在用的时候，会用到甘草的原因，就是因为他胃里面有腐坏的食物，甘草呢来把这个腐坏的食物分解掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，造成病人本来有病了，同时肠胃里面又有坏死的食物的时候，会造成肠胃的负担，所以我们在治病的同时呢，把肠胃的毒素分解掉。这样的话，这个药可以全心全意的来治疗这个病。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-9mtmmlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-9mtmmlm","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们看到现在，从伤寒论一直讲到金匮讲到现在，诸位有个观念，甘草甘草甘草，诸位去想一件事情，经方里面讲的是什么？讲的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正人的免疫系统，你的抵抗力是来自肠胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以说我们在治...桂技汤，麻黄汤，葛根汤，葛芩连汤，葛根黄苓黄连甘草...都有甘草在里面，为什么？就是因为要把胃气固到，所以说我们一直认为说："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要一个人的胃气有，他就不会死"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是第一个原则，第二个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们在治病的时候，要把肠胃里面存在的宿食的毒素分解掉，因为你生病了，你消化就不会很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那如果有甘草在里面的话，这个毒素不会造成病人的负担，所以其它的药可以全心全意地去治病。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-rey7jha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-rey7jha","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说甘草就是那么好用。这个观念一定要有。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170207-eaba5aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170207-eaba5aa","updated":"20240422170207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：紫参又名拳参，见中草药图鉴；"}]}]}